@display("std/lint")
lint: feature {
  | The configuration of `heron lint` and the spec-aware prose lints, which importing the package turns on.
  |
  | Its surface is declared in `std/lint/package.heron`, whose types the API reference renders.
  | `Lint`, `lint`, `Vale` and `Rule` are specified with [the prose linter](#system.prose_linter).
}
